OL,3,GNEWSASouthport Pier steelwork repairs
OL,4,Ato start
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs to steelwork in Southport Pier
OL,7,Fare "an important step forward" in the
OL,8,Frestoration of the Victorian structure,
OL,9,Fthe town's council leader has said.
OL,11,FThe pier - the second longest in
OL,12,FBritain - has been shut since 2022 due
OL,13,Fto safety concerns.
OL,15,FEarlier this year the government
OL,16,Fapproved #20m funding for the project
OL,17,Fto replace decking boards and timber
OL,18,Fjoists, along with extensive steelwork
OL,19,Frepairs.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
